{"actor_id":"par_claude_fable5","content_hash":"sha256:0539fc120eb9c2dd3f8513ebd2e285b53f34ad9aa143ce502654e253f42de8eb","event_id":"evt_evidencecommitted_mrh43nx7_22ef5ca1","event_type":"EvidenceCommitted","hash_version":"clista.event_hash.v1","payload":{"evidence":{"committedAt":"2026-07-12T01:25:47.611Z","committedByParticipantId":"par_claude_fable5","contentHash":"sha256:0fdce1c73b17b3f91da66ded530b1a3a4d3a5fa6c30434e163911efd87d5d2c7","finding":"DR Slice 2 (adopted): any output-shaping action MUST emit a typed event at action time — recall/reuse, arbitration, gate rejections, external ingestion. Records live, never reconstructed. Silence is a first-class defect, severity-distinct from (above) corruption. The sidecar gate's own silent rejections recorded as a known nonconformance.","id":"evd_mre_mrh43nx7_4faeb64c","object":"evidence","source":"lati-cooki/clista@ed5f92d docs/decision-records/DR-2026-07-12-silent-action-prohibition.md","threadId":"thd_mutual_reliance_evidence_mrh43nx1_dcfbe526"}},"previous_hash":"sha256:9d5cff4c2387b06dbf0dcac89c9850d3401f1b60604f2bc55c58c042b6c9ef7a","protocol_version":"clista.protocol.v0","thread_id":"thd_mutual_reliance_evidence_mrh43nx1_dcfbe526","timestamp":"2026-07-12T01:25:47.611Z"}
{"actor_id":"par_claude_fable5","content_hash":"sha256:b09339e1216fb383a98e4e99aa603f3580401338f31ae4216305041fcf913784","event_id":"evt_evidencecommitted_mrh43nx8_118dd55e","event_type":"EvidenceCommitted","hash_version":"clista.event_hash.v1","payload":{"evidence":{"committedAt":"2026-07-12T01:25:47.612Z","committedByParticipantId":"par_claude_fable5","contentHash":"sha256:6889f44ef2d99d4b6fb74035966a4d1908d36c8170782ffb4f1940a0907a15da","finding":"DR Slice 3 (adopted): PrecedentReference — holdings travel as tagged citations (source thread/event hash, live+source context hashes, precedent date, regrounding mode); the shape has no rationale field by design. Cache keys are hashes of declared decision-relevant context. Fail open to fresh computation.","id":"evd_mre_mrh43nx8_fb47ff9c","object":"evidence","source":"lati-cooki/clista@ecce00d docs/decision-records/DR-2026-07-12-precedent-as-citation.md","threadId":"thd_mutual_reliance_evidence_mrh43nx1_dcfbe526"}},"previous_hash":"sha256:0539fc120eb9c2dd3f8513ebd2e285b53f34ad9aa143ce502654e253f42de8eb","protocol_version":"clista.protocol.v0","thread_id":"thd_mutual_reliance_evidence_mrh43nx1_dcfbe526","timestamp":"2026-07-12T01:25:47.612Z"}
{"actor_id":"par_claude_fable5","content_hash":"sha256:8bbd9e68e1d6cf1c03aa02f9750752296a874bd7f7a8c3fabef9a23afa782287","event_id":"evt_evidencecommitted_mrh43nx8_73ffdd4f","event_type":"EvidenceCommitted","hash_version":"clista.event_hash.v1","payload":{"evidence":{"committedAt":"2026-07-12T01:25:47.612Z","committedByParticipantId":"par_claude_fable5","contentHash":"sha256:93bb5c1cc3025b4624c8b2734196be95410c345b57ffd105b4d0ffc3bd8da272","finding":"T1 agent variant executed live 2026-07-12: thread thd_sealed_run_mrh3w4h9_d5d01472, 13 events, maker/checker under distinct writer identities through the gate, zero rejections; chain verifies, log validates, report verifies. Prediction 'passes within two attempts' CONFIRMED on attempt one.","id":"evd_mre_mrh43nx8_a304fe56","object":"evidence","source":"lati-cooki/clista@0cd62dd..0260327 T1 agent run artifact (runs/t1-agent-2026-07-12T01-19-55-836Z/events.ndjson)","threadId":"thd_mutual_reliance_evidence_mrh43nx1_dcfbe526"}},"previous_hash":"sha256:b09339e1216fb383a98e4e99aa603f3580401338f31ae4216305041fcf913784","protocol_version":"clista.protocol.v0","thread_id":"thd_mutual_reliance_evidence_mrh43nx1_dcfbe526","timestamp":"2026-07-12T01:25:47.612Z"}
{"actor_id":"par_claude_fable5","content_hash":"sha256:c0b077d71e8044752847322d733f0a91df90430122ff80224a699fd0fc79ce3d","event_id":"evt_evidencecommitted_mrh43nx9_506920f5","event_type":"EvidenceCommitted","hash_version":"clista.event_hash.v1","payload":{"evidence":{"committedAt":"2026-07-12T01:25:47.613Z","committedByParticipantId":"par_claude_fable5","contentHash":"sha256:7600a0f751f83147e2f53665bfefe432396914de68e4b1de6e812ab1be40f237","finding":"T2 outcomes recorded against sealed predictions: deterministic diff catches a smuggled uncited claim the chain cannot see; agent variant prediction MISSED — a live model, forced into claims-with-citations, produced a fully-witnessed 8-claim report on attempt one. The miss is recorded plainly: forced citation is the cure and is easily satisfiable; unforced-prose diffing moves to probe-style T3/T4.","id":"evd_mre_mrh43nx9_64f85141","object":"evidence","source":"lati-cooki/clista@0260327 docs/decision-records/FINDINGS-T1-T2.md","threadId":"thd_mutual_reliance_evidence_mrh43nx1_dcfbe526"}},"previous_hash":"sha256:8bbd9e68e1d6cf1c03aa02f9750752296a874bd7f7a8c3fabef9a23afa782287","protocol_version":"clista.protocol.v0","thread_id":"thd_mutual_reliance_evidence_mrh43nx1_dcfbe526","timestamp":"2026-07-12T01:25:47.613Z"}
{"actor_id":"par_claude_fable5","content_hash":"sha256:93dd6c1d3ea92519325d3bde55ec9cf273013eed857f7a7b9a51ad76f488c460","event_id":"evt_sealedreport_mrh43nx9_e0422440","event_type":"SealedReport","hash_version":"clista.event_hash.v1","payload":{"sealedReport":{"claims":[{"citedEventHashes":["sha256:6f960b0a565372dbba4ad742b46ea3adde682826e9b556400870d75541c81c8f","sha256:d0bf838d8feb326d9c741efafd4ad30b08c598159c80e5da2c27816e471832a5","sha256:bcbddbb08b47538dc9535e6f62bde5e2b8fe5e57ed53c619fa5506029f59d20a"],"text":"On 2026-07-10/11 a three-phase probe of the clista-octopus-swarm Hive Mind cache demonstrated ventriloquism: a pre-recession precedent served into a stated-recession query with its original rationale intact, and a cosmetic-change query answered with factually false transplanted rationale."},{"citedEventHashes":["sha256:5df4803202842d4fb5bd8a9006291e58eb91a6e5e8ca244e5278e02fbd498c96"],"text":"Forensics established a defect class worse than corruption: the recall path wrote no server-side record at all — two production decisions are witnessed only by a chat transcript."},{"citedEventHashes":["sha256:ccbec7ddd7ee48b3a11759517e8f8820a86d0e7d5915f32311ccb7b5624ce507"],"text":"The Mutual Reliance proposal answered with an architecture: relocate trust from producers of work to verification of records, via three protocol-level commitments."},{"citedEventHashes":["sha256:9d5cff4c2387b06dbf0dcac89c9850d3401f1b60604f2bc55c58c042b6c9ef7a","sha256:0539fc120eb9c2dd3f8513ebd2e285b53f34ad9aa143ce502654e253f42de8eb","sha256:b09339e1216fb383a98e4e99aa603f3580401338f31ae4216305041fcf913784"],"text":"The three commitments were adopted as decision records: claim-citation report events (SealedReport), the silent-action prohibition, and precedent-as-citation semantics (PrecedentReference)."},{"citedEventHashes":["sha256:9d5cff4c2387b06dbf0dcac89c9850d3401f1b60604f2bc55c58c042b6c9ef7a","sha256:8bbd9e68e1d6cf1c03aa02f9750752296a874bd7f7a8c3fabef9a23afa782287","sha256:c0b077d71e8044752847322d733f0a91df90430122ff80224a699fd0fc79ce3d"],"text":"The report layer is now implemented and mechanically verifiable: SealedReport is a first-class event type and verifyReport runs the three checks (chain, existence, coverage) as a pure function, exposed as `clista report verify`."},{"citedEventHashes":["sha256:8bbd9e68e1d6cf1c03aa02f9750752296a874bd7f7a8c3fabef9a23afa782287"],"text":"T1 — the single-prompt sealed run with live model maker/checker roles — passed chain verification on attempt one, confirming the sealed prediction."},{"citedEventHashes":["sha256:c0b077d71e8044752847322d733f0a91df90430122ff80224a699fd0fc79ce3d"],"text":"T2's sealed prediction missed: under forced claims-with-citations structure a live model produced a fully-witnessed report immediately; the miss is itself recorded as evidence, and unforced-prose diffing is left, on record, to probe-style follow-ups."},{"citedEventHashes":["sha256:5e185dd5af7078c3bfec6a1d02e9bdcfb2be78b8077ba38823b3197688394841","sha256:ccbec7ddd7ee48b3a11759517e8f8820a86d0e7d5915f32311ccb7b5624ce507","sha256:9d5cff4c2387b06dbf0dcac89c9850d3401f1b60604f2bc55c58c042b6c9ef7a"],"text":"This thread is itself the artifact it describes: an append-only, hash-chained record whose final event commits to every event it cites — verifiable by anyone with `clista report verify`, trusting no one who produced it."}],"id":"rpt_mre_mrh43nx9_97738c40","object":"sealedReport","renderedAt":"2026-07-12T01:25:47.613Z","renderedByParticipantId":"par_claude_fable5","renderingRuleVersion":"clista.report_rendering.v0","threadId":"thd_mutual_reliance_evidence_mrh43nx1_dcfbe526"}},"previous_hash":"sha256:c0b077d71e8044752847322d733f0a91df90430122ff80224a699fd0fc79ce3d","protocol_version":"clista.protocol.v0","thread_id":"thd_mutual_reliance_evidence_mrh43nx1_dcfbe526","timestamp":"2026-07-12T01:25:47.613Z"}
